  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Procurement of Services is a component of Access &amp; Beneficiary Feedback Pilots Programme: Pilot programme to test mechanisms of seeking feedback by people directly affected by aid projects reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;265,710. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Democratic participation and civil society, Research/scientific institutions, Technological research and development.</narrative>
  </description>
